      "title": "Remove background: the subject on one flat color with BiRefNet",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Remove background: the subject on one flat color with BiRefNet\n\nFinds the subject of your image with a BiRefNet model and places it over one flat color, such as white or black. The model file and the color are inputs. Built from Comfy's template utility_birefnet_remove_background.\n\n## Models\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors): BiRefNet, by ZhengPeng7, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
